    "quote": "Theorem 3.1. Let C be an ∞-category and h_{x} ∶C^{op} →Grpd_{∞} be the functor"
  },
  "hypotheses": "$\\cC$ 是 $\\infty$-范畴，$h_{x}=\\Maps_{\\cC}(-,x)$，$G\\colon\\cC^{\\op}\\to\\Grpd_\\infty$",
  "conclusion": "取值映射给出等价 $\\Maps_{\\Fun(\\cC^{\\op},\\Grpd_\\infty)}(h_{x},G)\\xrightarrow{\\ \\simeq\\ }\\Maps(h_{x}(x),G(x))\\xrightarrow{\\mathrm{ev}_{\\id_{x}}}G(x)$。",
  "proof_skeleton": [
    "步骤1 用左右 Kan 扩张把问题化归到 $\\cC=\\Delta^{0}$",
    "步骤2 在单点上等价显然",
    "步骤3 由自然性拼回一般 $\\cC$"
  ],
